// test-error
// #1866: a scope member is not an external function.
//
// `helper` exists only as `Test.helper` (C name `Test__helper`). From `main`,
// outside the scope, a bare `helper` names nothing (ADR-057 resolves bare
// names outward from the enclosing scope, and `main` has none). The analyzer
// used to find `Test.helper` in the symbol table by its bare name and accept
// the call as external, emitting `helper();` with no declaration.
scope Test {
    public void helper() {
        u32 x <- 1;
    }
}

void main() {
    helper();
}
